here, at a layer X: ended := `endedX X` (`beside_is_fill`) · `FoldFirst₃`, `FoldRest₃`, `Readers₃`;
`FoldFirst₃.ofRcLast` · Oc a letter; `LastOwed.atRc`.

Closed letters: the shared seat `seatK Z N`; hand (what the start reads of the first chain's last
state) and ended (of the shared chain's, where the layer X says yes); the layer on the last chain's
own state Y := `yTree cs S`; the codes cs := (p14At Z).codes; smp := `smpLast`; mine := `mineOf`;
num := `numAt D.t₁ D.t₂ 2`; no := `noAt D.t₁ D.t₂ n₁ ft nΩ`; ML := `rowsOpen`; t₁ | t₂ := D.t₁ |
D.t₂.
  `PlanOk₃`: THE TESTS ON THE PLAN: THIRTY-THREE FIELDS: `LastPlan8`'s eight; closed (`ClosedL` at
    the place); stretch; someW, someI, someO, apartWO, apartIO; free0; oneSeat; dataIs; planOk;
    ownMask; twoStages; places; oneOmega; omegaSeat; mineI; mineW; seatsApart; allSeats; planAt
