  `LastCore₃`: these four lists; TWO ON THE LETTER Oc: ocIs, ocBelow; THE BRIDGE reached (the
    promise at border 2 gives Rch): FORTY-THREE. `LastOwed`: that, with ROW 0's psIs, joint, dot:
